	(descr "Panasonic AXK5S80337YG, P5KS 0.5mm-pitch 80-pin board-to-board SOCKET, 7.0/8.0/9.0mm mated height, with positioning bosses. Land pattern and STEP from the EE Concierge manufacturer footprint (cad/eec/, Panasonic-AXK5S80337YG-MFG; matches con_eng_p5k.pdf: 6.40 outer / 2.40 inner span). Odd pins on the +Y row, pin 1 at -X. Boss holes 2x 0.65mm NPTH per AXK.pdf p.10 (C = B+2.5 = 22.0, 3.00 apart in Y): (-11.0,-1.5) and (+11.0,+1.5). ASSUMPTION: Panasonic's drawing shows no pin numbers; the boss diagonal is taken with pin 1 at the drawing's lower left (the MFG footprint's orientation). Confirm against Panasonic's product specification drawing before fab. The STEP model has no bosses.")
